=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with any {p:Voidwatch Officer} in a {p:Shadowreign} area to receive a {@k}{k:Voidwatch alarum}.
** If you have not previously returned to the Bulwark Gate in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)}, the {p:Voidwatch Officer} will not give you the alarum. You must first receive a cutscene there which will reward you with 30,000 gil. You must wait until the next game day and zone after receiving this cutscene, then speak with a {p:Voidwatch Officer} to activate the quest. {p:Voidwatch Officer} MUST be from the Shadowreign era.

* Proceed to the Bulwark Gate (F-6) in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} for a cutscene.
** Voidwatch Warp to {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} is the quickest and most direct way to get there.
** At the end of the cutscene, the key items {@k}{k:White stratum abyssite VI} and {@k}{k:Starlight Voidwatcher's emblem} will be received, the quest will be completed, and the next quest will be automatically flagged.

